      "content": "It is incredibly heavy to feel like your survival is a debt to those you hurt, but please know that you are not burdened by a promise you cannot keep because life does not end in a \"math\" that must be paid out. Your healing is the only way to stop the pain in the present and the past for those you care about most. I am here to help you process these feelings so you can feel a little lighter about today.",
